      "rawSource": "\t\n\tfor each DB.Palet\n\t\twhere PaletId \u003E 0\n\t\twhere WWPBaseObjects.SMS.PaletNoSerie.Trim() = \u0026PaletNoSerie.Trim()\n\t\t\u0026PaletId = PaletId\n\t\t\n\t\t\u0026Palet.Load(\u0026PaletId)\n\t\t\u0026PaletItem = New()\n\t\t\u0026PaletItem.FromJson(\u0026Palet.ToJson())\n\t\tExit\n\tendfor\n",
